Clue data sources
-----------------
French departement -> region and chef-lieu, and commune names:
  @etalab/decoupage-administratif (npm), from French government open data
  (INSEE / Etalab), Licence Ouverte. Attribution to Etalab required.

French region outlines (for the grouping clue):
  https://github.com/gregoiredavid/france-geojson, from IGN/Etalab open data.

US state capitals:
  usa-states (npm), MIT.

US census divisions:
  https://github.com/cphalpert/census-regions (census.csv). The repository
  states no licence. The classification is US Census Bureau work and so in the
  public domain; only the convenience CSV is that repository's.

Regenerate with src/build-clues.py; see its docstring for the fetch commands.
